'''Calatañazor''' ({{Langx|ar|قلعة النسور|Qal`at an-Nusur|castle of the eagle}}) is an urban [[communes of Balisca|commune]] within the [[Jaguarundi]] [[regions of Balisca|region]] of [[Araucaria]], located in the northern extremity of the [[Guadazequias Valley]], straddling the [[Guadazequias river]].  

